    {
      "name": "--One Hit Kills Enemy (Req. MS)",
      "description": "This affects also hacks such as Short Circuit, Contagion etc., so will kill enemies instantly. Note that this cheat may cause progression issues in some rare situations, such as the drone attack on Panam`s car or whenever using the car turret gun! If and when this happens, be sure to disable the cheat and reload your last save/checkpoint to be able to complete the mission.",
      "type": "checkbox",
