          "off": "00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Invincible",
      "description": "Prevents getting hit and effects. Does not prevent fall damage. Use god mode if you want to prevent it.\r\nCheat has not been throughly tested so might cause progressions issues or other issues.",
