    {
      "name": "Manual Weapon Rapid Fire",
      "description": "The cheat eliminates the delay between manual shots. Mostly handy with weapons like the 10mm pistol. Using this cheat is pointless if you enabled the Small Arms Fully Automatic cheat.",
