    {
      "name": "Small Arms Fully Automatic",
      "description": "The cheat code modifies all semi-automatic small arms to behave as fully automatic weapons. Additionally, it eliminates the spin-up delay and cooldown period for weapons like the mini-gun.  If you want to disable this option after it took effect, you may need to restart/reload the game in order to restore the original weapon functionality.",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "memory": [
        {
